{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visual Novel with Choices!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/\u6587\u7ae0\u9876\u56fe.gif?t=1745396888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Intro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/ENGchoice_1.gif?t=1745396888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>If you're reading this part:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1. You REALLY care about the game details \u2192 THANK YOU! \ud83d\ude4f</strong><br><strong><u>The game is a wild (but cool!)\u00a0sci-fi philosophy adventure!</u></strong> It looks silly but hides deep ideas. That's all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2. You're TOO IMPATIENT and scrolled down too fast \u2192</strong><br>We advise you to read an amazing book, <i>Zen and the Art of Motorcycle Maintenance</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3. You\u2019re NEW to Visual Novel and don\u2019t know how choices work \u2192</strong><br><strong>Every choice will take you to different storyline.</strong> Remember this rule!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/ENGchoice_2.gif?t=1745396888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u26a1 Girl 1</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/20250422-141648.png?t=1745396888\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is one of the 5 main girls! </strong>She looks brave on the surface, but actually is a OTAKU. To get her solo photo ,We <strong>promised to blur her face</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3b <strong>SUNFLOWER</strong> = <strong>YOU!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/20250422-141901.png?t=1745396888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you see something not a sunflower in this location, in other pics of this page\u2192 it proves a fact, your brain or our devs\u2019 , are in goblin mode. But don't worry \u2013 <strong>this means the story is CRAZY GOOD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u26a1 <strong>Girl 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/20250422-141913.png?t=1745396888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shidina is a vampire pop star!</strong> Our boss hates this character, so we decided to keep her in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 <strong>Girl 3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/20250422-141923.png?t=1745396888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those legs? A FURRY! But NOT like normal ones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 <strong>Girls 4 &amp; 5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/20250422-141931.png?t=1745396888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They exist! Well...</strong>uh...they are really here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/ENGchoice_3.gif?t=1745396888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>new visual novel engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We used a new visual novel engine to create this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are real humans and professional game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We promise with our hearts: every story and line in the game was written by hand. No AI was used at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/ENGchoice_4.gif?t=1745396888\" />\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>You were chosen to play this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you started reading from the top, picked the fourth choice, then jumped straight to this option \u2014 you have to play this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re perfect for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our \u2018scouters\u2019 couldn\u2019t even calculate how well you match. These devices broke and ended up hurting our right eyes, because of you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668550?t=1745396888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/6008d56434377795640a83f322772b452f5c2f95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745396888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/22a19c8d5935854a91c9447307e3ed25dae78529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745396888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/22a19c8d59358